# Backend Conventions

- Type-hint all public functions; target mypy strict on `app/`
- Use `structlog` for structured JSON logs
- DB access via `async_session_factory` / `get_db` dependency
- Tool implementations live in `app/serving/tools.py` — REST and MCP share them
- Payment logic only in `app/payments/` — never inline in routes
- New sources: subclass `app/ingestion/base.py`, do not fork pipeline

```python
# ✅ Metering in route
await MeteringService(db).authorize("search_listings", api_key=x_api_key)

# ❌ Never skip metering
return await ToolService(db).search_listings(body)
```
